# comments
# comment 0027d380 end-of-battle check: walks the btlAction list; hero dead -> outcome 2 (lose), all enemies dead -> 1 (win, unless the boss rule sub_2FD660), only enemies left -> 3; outcome to gBtl+0x1C, returns 1 when over
# comment 0027dcd0 btlTableLoad(record, sync): name or name_F by datGetScenarioMode; file = {u32 size, bytes} sections each at the next multiple of 16; *dst[k] = 0x875D00 + offset, memcpy(size), offset += align16(size)
# comment 002ff890 datUnitInit(unit, kind, id): 60-byte unit; +0 flags (bit 2 enemy), +2 id, +4 base id, +6 level, +8 hp, +0xA sp, +0xC status (bit 19 dead), +0x14 effect flags, +0x1C buff nibbles, +0x29 turn counters
# comment 00303130 damage/recovery: SkillRecord+17/+20 formula kind (17 kinds), AICALC fn 1/2/3/15, boosts x1.25/x1.5, critical x2 (status 0x10 + skill 543), clamp(dmg, SkillRecord+40, 31000) * (datCalcRand(11) + 95) / 100
# comment 00306e80 affinity word of a unit for element e: enemy UNIT.TBL sec 1 [base_id*32 + 2e], PC via persona; rate = 5 * low byte, high byte -> bits 24..31 (null/repel/absorb/weak/resist); passive skills 464..507 and the element walls (buff slots 13..16)
# comment 00309490 hit check: result 1 hit, 4 miss, 256 null, 512 repel/evade, 1024 drain; accuracy clamp(AICALC fn 4 * m - evasion, 50, 99) > datCalcRand(100)
# comment 0030fc40 datScriptCalc(fn, attacker, target, skill, mode): stores 0x957190..0x9571A0, picks sDatScriptFuncTbl2/3 by flags 0x1311/0x1319 else Tbl1 (17 entries), returns gDatScriptResult
